# Build / data
# - extension/data/law-index.json + law-amendments.json ARE committed
#   (extension fetches both at runtime; see verifier.js loadIndex)
# - .br companions are not used at runtime (KNOWN_ISSUES.md #8) — skip them
# - data/legalize-kr/ is the raw Legalize KR clone used by build_index.py;
#   it's hundreds of MB and is reproducible from upstream
data/legalize-kr/
extension/data/law-index.json.br
extension/data/law-amendments.json.br

